++  "body": "I tried cross-compile with mips architecture. I met two errors.\r\n\r\n1. Function redefinition error.\r\nWhen MIPS macro was defined, than occurred 'sys_set_thread_area' function redefinition error on [ldt.c:112](https://github.com/strace/strace/blob/master/ldt.c#L112). It will has same problem on [ldt.c:112](https://github.com/strace/strace/blob/master/ldt.c#L112), [ldt.c:122](https://github.com/strace/strace/blob/master/ldt.c#L122) when M68K macro was defined.\r\n\r\n2. Undeclared variable error.\r\nThere was undeclared variable problems on [sysmips.c:53](https://github.com/strace/strace/blob/master/sysmips.c#L53), [sysmips.c:66](https://github.com/strace/strace/blob/master/sysmips.c#L66), [sysmips.c:70](https://github.com/strace/strace/blob/master/sysmips.c#L70), when SETNAME, MIPS_ATOMIC_SET, MIPS_FIXADE macro wasn't defined. So I found reference source code on [chromium google source](https://chromium.googlesource.com/android_ndk/+/r14b/sysroot/usr/include/mipsel-linux-android/asm/sysmips.h), and set macro value.\r\n\r\nThank you.",
