++  "body": "Sorry but your cross for MIPS is broken:\r\n1. struct user_desc is defined on X86 only, so if you see sys_set_thread_area redefinition on MIPS, then it's not a proper MIPS;\r\n2. these constants are always defined on MIPS by <asm/sysmips.h>, so if they are not defined, then it's not a proper MIPS.",
