++  "body": "Actually, my own case of debugging followed exactly these levels of \"filtering\" the output of strace  (even without using this option): first, I looked through the socket operations in the strace output and looked for errors. I didn't see any errors (and the `poll` syscalls were formally a success, so I didn't pay attention) and couldn't understand what went wrong. After some time, I came to an idea what might be wrong (by other means, not strace), and only then I returned to the output of strace and noticed these error values; and this was the explanation indeed.",
