++  "body": "Yes.  It kind of looks like it's looking in both places, but bombs when it can't find it in the latter?\r\n\r\n```\r\n./configure --prefix=/packages/strace/strace-4.26 --with-libunwind --with-libiberty\r\n...\r\nchecking libunwind-ptrace.h usability... yes\r\nchecking libunwind-ptrace.h presence... yes\r\nchecking for libunwind-ptrace.h... yes\r\nchecking for backtrace in -lunwind... yes\r\nchecking for unw_create_addr_space in libunwind-generic... yes\r\nchecking for _UPT_create in -lunwind-ptrace... yes\r\nchecking whether to enable stack tracing support... yes, using libunwind\r\nchecking demangle.h usability... yes\r\nchecking demangle.h presence... yes\r\nchecking for demangle.h... yes\r\nchecking for cplus_demangle in -liberty... yes\r\nchecking libiberty/demangle.h usability... no\r\nchecking libiberty/demangle.h presence... no\r\nchecking for libiberty/demangle.h... no\r\nconfigure: error: in `/packages/src/strace/strace-4.26':\r\nconfigure: error: failed to find demangle.h\r\nSee `config.log' for more details\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\nconfigure:15252: checking whether to enable stack tracing support\r\nconfigure:15289: result: yes, using libunwind\r\nconfigure:15318: checking demangle.h usability\r\nconfigure:15318: gcc -std=gnu99 -c -g -O2   conftest.c >&5\r\nconfigure:15318: $? = 0\r\nconfigure:15318: result: yes\r\nconfigure:15318: checking demangle.h presence\r\nconfigure:15318: gcc -std=gnu99 -E   conftest.c\r\nconfigure:15318: $? = 0\r\nconfigure:15318: result: yes\r\nconfigure:15318: checking for demangle.h\r\nconfigure:15318: result: yes\r\nconfigure:15325: checking for cplus_demangle in -liberty\r\nconfigure:15350: gcc -std=gnu99 -o conftest -g -O2     conftest.c -liberty   >&5\r\nconfigure:15350: $? = 0\r\nconfigure:15359: result: yes\r\nconfigure:15318: checking libiberty/demangle.h usability\r\nconfigure:15318: gcc -std=gnu99 -c -g -O2   conftest.c >&5\r\nconftest.c:396:32: fatal error: libiberty/demangle.h: No such file or directory\r\n #include <libiberty/demangle.h>\r\n                                ^\r\ncompilation terminated.\r\n```",
