++  "body": "On Wed, Feb 17, 2021 at 09:48:01PM -0800, Chih-Hsuan Yen wrote:\n> Version 5.11 includes bundled linux/socket.h (4aeaf0c86d3a7cbc8b7608edeea8e4b1a676a391), and then building strace for Android is broken.\n[...]\n> If I remove bundled `linux/socket.h`, building is fine for both x86_64 and aarch64.\n\nCould you show us that Android's linux/socket.h that apparently defines\nsockaddr_storage (which mainline include/uapi/linux/socket.h never did),\nplease?\n",
