++  "body": "I got it to compile with ndk, here's my build script: https://github.com/Zackptg5/Cross-Compiled-Binaries-Android/tree/master/build_script\r\n\r\nNDK has static_assert already defined but it's different than the one included in strace and so I have configure ignore ndk's. Also needed to specify arm64's ac_cv_prog_CC_FOR_M32 to arm clang\r\n\r\nThese fixes were needed starting with strace version 5.6. It works up to 5.10, then with 5.11, something changed and so I'm working on getting that to compile now. 5.5 didn't need any of the above",
