++  "updated_at": "2021-03-29T21:53:35Z",
++  "body": "Yes it is specific to musl. Musl defines some of the __UAPI flags in [in.h](https://git.musl-libc.org/cgit/musl/tree/include/netinet/in.h#n397) which causes problems with versions of strace that include the bundled uapi headers (basically v5.10-272-g5bd8364f4 onward).\r\n\r\nIt looks like there's some attempt in the headers to coordinate with `_NETINET_IN_H`, `__USE_MISC` and `__USE_GNU` but I guess the order of includes might defeat this.",
++  "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
