++  "body": "On Tue, Aug 30, 2022 at 7:27 PM Micka\u00ebl Sala\u00fcn ***@***.***> wrote:\n> I noticed that commit d65d4c1 added an exception for the Landlock ruleset file descriptor name. I think this is not needed because the original kernel commit has been backported to the latest supported kernel version (Linux 5.15).\n\nSince there are kernels released that use the original name, strace\nhas to account for this ABI breakage (as well as for all others)\nvirtually forever, as it (as well as its test suite) aims to work on\nwide variety of kernels, not only the latest ones.\n\n-- \nEugene Syromyatnikov\n***@***.***\n***@***.***{ru|org}\n",
