++  "updated_at": "2023-01-16T11:27:41Z",
++  "body": "As far as I know, it's not possible to run Differential ShellCheck locally. It was developed for GitHub in the first place. I have recently worked towards enabling Differential ShellCheck for other services like GitLab and potentially local testing. But I can't promise when this will be done and ready to use.\r\n\r\nCurrently, the only way how to verify your shell script changes before creating PR is to push the changes into a branch (on GitHub), and Differential ShellCheck runs and reports back to you if any defects were added by your commit. ",
