++  "body": "Looks like [an old glibc bug](https://sourceware.org/git/?p=glibc.git;a=commitdiff;h=4c0a1e6392fc9f667dba272dc13d94dc5c54813e).\r\n\r\nLikely the following sysdeps/unix/sysv/linux/alpha/bits/siginfo-arch.h would fix it:\r\n```\r\n/* Architecture-specific adjustments to siginfo_t.  Alpha version.  */\r\n#ifndef _BITS_SIGINFO_ARCH_H\r\n#define _BITS_SIGINFO_ARCH_H 1\r\n\r\n#define __SI_SIGFAULT_ADDL \\\r\n  int _si_trapno;\r\n\r\n#define si_trapno\t_sifields._sigfault._si_trapno\r\n\r\n#endif\r\n```",
