++  "body": "On Tue, Apr 04, 2023 at 11:55:37AM -0700, John Reiser wrote:\n> Enables easy application of strace to multi-call executables\n> which interpret argv[0], such as busybox or kmod.\n\nSounds like a useful feature.\n\n> ---\n>  src/strace.c | 8 ++++++++\n>  1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)\n> \n> diff --git a/src/strace.c b/src/strace.c\n> index 7a58bdbd6..4963e4251 100644\n> --- a/src/strace.c\n> +++ b/src/strace.c\n> @@ -183,6 +183,7 @@ static size_t tcb_wait_tab_size;\n>  #ifndef HAVE_PROGRAM_INVOCATION_NAME\n>  char *program_invocation_name;\n>  #endif\n> +char *argv0; /* override argv[0] on execve */\n> \n>  unsigned os_release; /* generated from uname()'s u.release */\n> \n> @@ -1526,6 +1527,8 @@ exec_or_die(void)\n>  \t\t  seccomp_filtering ? \"enabled\" : \"disabled\");\n>  \tif (seccomp_filtering)\n>  \t\tinit_seccomp_filter();\n> +\tif (argv0 && params->argv)\n> +\t\tparams->argv[0] = argv0;\n\nI think it is better to be updated in startup_child, right after setting\nparams_for_tracee.argv.\n\n>  \texecve(params->pathname, params->argv, params->env);\n>  \tperror_msg_and_die(\"exec\");\n>  }\n> @@ -2272,6 +2275,7 @@ init(int argc, char *argv[])\n>  \t\tGETOPT_QUAL_DECODE_FD,\n>  \t\tGETOPT_QUAL_DECODE_PID,\n>  \t\tGETOPT_QUAL_SECONTEXT,\n> +\t\tGETOPT_ARGV0,\n\nI would put it after GETOPT_TIPS.\n\n>  \t};\n>  \tstatic const struct option longopts[] = {\n>  \t\t{ \"columns\",\t\trequired_argument, 0, 'a' },\n> @@ -2334,6 +2338,7 @@ init(int argc, char *argv[])\n>  \t\t{ \"decode-pids\",required_argument, 0, GETOPT_QUAL_DECODE_PID },\n>  \t\t{ \"secontext\",\toptional_argument, 0, GETOPT_QUAL_SECONTEXT },\n> \n> +\t\t{ \"argv0\",\trequired_argument, 0, GETOPT_ARGV0 },\n\nDitto, I'd rather put it after the \"tips\" option.\n\n>  \t\t{ 0, 0, 0, 0 }\n>  \t};\n> \n> @@ -2591,6 +2596,9 @@ init(int argc, char *argv[])\n>  \t\tcase GETOPT_QUAL_DECODE_PID:\n>  \t\t\tqualify_decode_pid(optarg);\n>  \t\t\tbreak;\n> +\t\tcase GETOPT_ARGV0:\n> +\t\t\targv0 = optarg;\n> +\t\t\tbreak;\n>  \t\tdefault:\n>  \t\t\terror_msg_and_help(NULL);\n>  \t\t\tbreak;\n\nUpdates of usage(), the doc/strace.1.in and NEWS seem to be missing,\nyou might want to use commit v4.22~8, for example, as a possible reference.\n",
