++  "body": "Sorry, I cannot reproduce this issue.  When strace is built with kernel headers from linux v6.3 or older, the configure script automatically select the bundled headers. Only when the kernel headers come from linux v6.4-rc1 or newer, the configure script automatically select the system headers, and in this case commit 65ecda71587add30414c373f6f3716461aeaaf2c is necessary for the build to succeed.",
