++  "body": "Thanks for the confirmation! I ended up using a locally-patched version as well. I was tracing rtnl, so it took a while to figure out why I was still seeing output without the netlink header, until I realized `decode_netlink_netfilter` only deals with nfnetlink. :slightly_smiling_face:  This is the patch I settled on:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git src/netlink.c src/netlink.c\r\nindex 0e31168c3..d5f0d1436 100644\r\n--- src/netlink.c\r\n+++ src/netlink.c\r\n@@ -705,8 +705,7 @@ decode_netlink(struct tcb *const tcp,\r\n                        is_array = true;\r\n                }\r\n\r\n-               decode_nlmsghdr_with_payload(tcp, fd, family,\r\n-                                            &nlmsghdr, addr, len);\r\n+               printstr_ex(tcp, addr, len, QUOTE_FORCE_HEX);\r\n\r\n                if (!next_addr)\r\n                        break;\r\n```",
