++  "body": "> Sorry, I failed to understand what's the problem you're trying to address, and the reproducer written in a cryptic language doesn't help either.\r\n\r\nI tried writing a C program and it produced the same problem.\r\nuse `strace -f ./test` to start tracing the test program. use `Ctrl + c` to stop the strace, it will blocked. `Ctrl + c` must be excute within 10 seconds before sleep ends.\r\n```\r\n#include <sys/types.h>\r\n#include <sys/wait.h>\r\n#include <unistd.h>\r\n\r\nint main(int argc, char *argv[])\r\n{\r\n\tint status;\r\n\tpid_t pid = vfork();\r\n\tif (!pid) {\r\n\t\tsleep(10);\r\n\t\t_exit(0);\r\n\t} else if (pid > 0) {\r\n\t\twaitpid(pid, &status, 0);\r\n\t}\r\n\treturn 0;\r\n}\r\n```",
