++  "body": "The second TCGETS is called from ` > /usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libc.so.6(tcsetattr+0x2d) [0xfd10d]`.\r\n\r\nThe first TCSETS is called from ` > /usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libc.so.6(tcsetattr+0xab) [0xfd18b]`.\r\n\r\nThe last TCGETS is called from ` > /usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libc.so.6(tcsetattr+0xd6) [0xfd1b6]`.\r\n\r\nAll they are called from tcsetattr.\r\n\r\nDon't tcsetattr+0x2d, tcsetattr+0xab, and tcsetattr+0xd6 help you inspect the disassembled code?",
