++  "body": "There *are* 3 syscalls instructions. Why? I checked glibc source code earlier, it was not present in trunk.\r\n\r\nlibc in the VM is 2.36. source code for tcsetattr is here https://github.com/bminor/glibc/blob/glibc-2.36/sysdeps/unix/sysv/linux/tcsetattr.c#L44\r\n\r\nthere's only one syscall being done.\r\n\r\nChecked the source tarball the debian package is built from, the source code is the same.",
