++  "body": "## [Codecov](https://app.codecov.io/gh/strace/strace/pull/282?src=pr&el=h1&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=github&utm_content=comment&utm_campaign=pr+comments&utm_term=strace) Report\nAttention: `5 lines` in your changes are missing coverage. Please review.\n> Comparison is base [(`e43bf81`)](https://app.codecov.io/gh/strace/strace/commit/e43bf81c055ab2d91e72fd4bfdaa51018142dea9?el=desc&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=github&utm_content=comment&utm_campaign=pr+comments&utm_term=strace) 91.60% compared to head [(`71a15d8`)](https://app.codecov.io/gh/strace/strace/pull/282?src=pr&el=desc&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=github&utm_content=comment&utm_campaign=pr+comments&utm_term=strace) 91.58%.\n> Report is 6 commits behind head on master.\n\n> :exclamation: Current head 71a15d8 differs from pull request most recent head afdacd8. Consider uploading reports for the commit afdacd8 to get more accurate results\n\n| [Files](https://app.codecov.io/gh/strace/strace/pull/282?src=pr&el=tree&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=github&utm_content=comment&utm_campaign=pr+comments&utm_term=strace) | Patch % | Lines |\n|---|---|---|\n| [src/unwind.c](https://app.codecov.io/gh/strace/strace/pull/282?src=pr&el=tree&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=github&utm_content=comment&utm_campaign=pr+comments&utm_term=strace#diff-c3JjL3Vud2luZC5j) | 55.55% | [4 Missing :warning: ](https://app.codecov.io/gh/strace/strace/pull/282?src=pr&el=tree&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=github&utm_content=comment&utm_campaign=pr+comments&utm_term=strace) |\n| [src/strace.c](https://app.codecov.io/gh/strace/strace/pull/282?src=pr&el=tree&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=github&utm_content=comment&utm_campaign=pr+comments&utm_term=strace#diff-c3JjL3N0cmFjZS5j) | 95.45% | [1 Missing :warning: ](https://app.codecov.io/gh/strace/strace/pull/282?src=pr&el=tree&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=github&utm_content=comment&utm_campaign=pr+comments&utm_term=strace) |\n\n<details><summary>Additional details and impacted files</summary>\n\n\n```diff\n@@            Coverage Diff             @@\n##           master     #282      +/-   ##\n==========================================\n- Coverage   91.60%   91.58%   -0.02%     \n==========================================\n  Files         283      283              \n  Lines       24238    24263      +25     \n==========================================\n+ Hits        22203    22222      +19     \n- Misses       2035     2041       +6     \n```\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n[:umbrella: View full report in Codecov by Sentry](https://app.codecov.io/gh/strace/strace/pull/282?src=pr&el=continue&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=github&utm_content=comment&utm_campaign=pr+comments&utm_term=strace).   \n:loudspeaker: Have feedback on the report? [Share it here](https://about.codecov.io/codecov-pr-comment-feedback/?utm_medium=referral&utm_source=github&utm_content=comment&utm_campaign=pr+comments&utm_term=strace).\n",
