++  "body": "So far, this specific request seems to be mostly covered (albeit with some usage of standard tools):\r\n * \"stop after having captured N events\" \u2014 handled by  `--limit-syscalls=` now;\r\n * \"stop after having written an -o output file of more than N bytes\" \u2014 can be achieved with `strace -I1 -o\"|head -c $N > $output\" `;\r\n * \"stop after having run for N seconds\" \u2014 `timeout $N strace`.",
