++  "body": "I want to have a way to specify a condition conceptually based on the output of `-c` option.\r\n\r\n```\r\n% time     seconds  usecs/call     calls    errors syscall\r\n------ ----------- ----------- --------- --------- ----------------\r\n 35.56    0.000677         677         1           execve\r\n 19.75    0.000376           7        48           write\r\n 15.44    0.000294          13        22           mmap\r\n  6.46    0.000123          61         2           getdents64\r\n  4.83    0.000092          13         7         3 openat\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ strace -a 'expression:(stop-if (or (> (calls \"mmap\") 10) (> (errors \"openat\") 2)))'\r\n```\r\n",
