++  "body": "```\r\nunshare(CLONE_NEWUSER|CLONE_NEWNET)     = 0 (net:[4026537408])\r\n```\r\n\r\nI came up with a more user-friendly output format.\r\n\r\n```\r\nunshare(CLONE_NEWUSER|CLONE_NEWNET)     = 0 (net:[4026537002 => 4026537408])\r\n```\r\n\r\nIs this overkill? \r\n\r\n\r\nI cannot implement everything at once. To contribute incrementally, I propose the initial output format as `-e namespace=switchTo` and the newer one as `-e namespace=switchFromTo`.\r\n\r\nThis pull request focuses on `-e namespace=switchTo` (or `-e ns=switchTo`).\r\nIf you find a better option name, please let me know.\r\n",
