++  "body": "Seems commit b2535111a44b59bd86fe63ebcc8efe5cac57bffc broke compiling tests on the ppc64le platforms (Fedora 42 with `gcc-15.2.1-7.fc42.ppc64le`). Running `make check` fails with\n````\n...\ngcc -DHAVE_CONFIG_H    -I. -I../src/linux/powerpc64le -I../src/linux/powerpc64le -I../src/linux/generic -I../src/linux/generic -I../src -I../src -isystem ../bundled/linux/arch/powerpc/include/uapi -isystem ../bundled/linux/include/uapi -DSTRACE_SIZEOF_KERNEL_LONG_T=8 -DTESTS_SIZEOF_KERNEL_LONG_T=8 -DSTRACE_SIZEOF_LONG=8 -DTESTS_SIZEOF_LONG=8  -isystem ./bundled/linux/arch/powerpc/include/uapi -isystem ./bundled/linux/include/uapi -Wall -Wextra -Wno-missing-field-initializers -Wno-unused-parameter -Wdate-time -Wformat-security -Wimplicit-fallthrough=5 -Winit-self -Wlogical-op -Wmissing-prototypes -Wnested-externs -Wold-style-definition -Wtrampolines -Wundef -Wwrite-strings -Werror -Wno-error=unterminated-string-initialization -Wno-error=stringop-overflow -g -O2 -MT ioctl_pidfd_get_info-success.o -MD -MP -MF $depbase.Tpo -c -o ioctl_pidfd_get_info-success.o ioctl_pidfd_get_info-success.c &&\\\nmv -f $depbase.Tpo $depbase.Po\nIn file included from ioctl_pidfd_get_info-success.c:2:\nioctl_pidfd_get_info.c: In function \u2018injected_pidfd_get_info_decode_checks\u2019:\nioctl_pidfd_get_info.c:348:16: error: format \u2018%llu\u2019 expects argument of type \u2018long long unsigned int\u2019, but argument 4 has type \u2018__u64\u2019 {aka \u2018long unsigned int\u2019} [-Werror=format=]\n  348 |         printf(\"ioctl(-1, \" XLAT_FMT \", {mask=%s\"\n      |                ^~~~~~~~~~~~\n......\n  357 |                info->cgroupid, info->pid, info->tgid, info->ppid,\n      |                ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n      |                    |\n      |                    __u64 {aka long unsigned int}\nioctl_pidfd_get_info.c:349:31: note: format string is defined here\n  349 |                \", cgroupid=%llu, pid=%d, tgid=%d, ppid=%d\"\n      |                            ~~~^\n      |                               |\n      |                               long long unsigned int\n      |                            %lu\nioctl_pidfd_get_info.c:368:16: error: format \u2018%llu\u2019 expects argument of type \u2018long long unsigned int\u2019, but argument 4 has type \u2018__u64\u2019 {aka \u2018long unsigned int\u2019} [-Werror=format=]\n  368 |         printf(\"ioctl(-1, \" XLAT_FMT \", {mask=%s\"\n      |                ^~~~~~~~~~~~\n......\n  377 |                info->cgroupid, info->pid, info->tgid, info->ppid,\n      |                ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n      |                    |\n      |                    __u64 {aka long unsigned int}\nioctl_pidfd_get_info.c:369:31: note: format string is defined here\n  369 |                \", cgroupid=%llu, pid=%d, tgid=%d, ppid=%d\"\n      |                            ~~~^\n      |                               |\n      |                               long long unsigned int\n      |                            %lu\nioctl_pidfd_get_info.c:387:16: error: format \u2018%llu\u2019 expects argument of type \u2018long long unsigned int\u2019, but argument 4 has type \u2018__u64\u2019 {aka \u2018long unsigned int\u2019} [-Werror=format=]\n  387 |         printf(\"ioctl(-1, \" XLAT_FMT \", {mask=%s\"\n      |                ^~~~~~~~~~~~\n......\n  396 |                info->cgroupid, info->pid, info->tgid, info->ppid,\n      |                ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n      |                    |\n      |                    __u64 {aka long unsigned int}\nioctl_pidfd_get_info.c:388:31: note: format string is defined here\n  388 |                \", cgroupid=%llu, pid=%d, tgid=%d, ppid=%d\"\n      |                            ~~~^\n      |                               |\n      |                               long long unsigned int\n      |                            %lu\nioctl_pidfd_get_info.c:405:16: error: format \u2018%llu\u2019 expects argument of type \u2018long long unsigned int\u2019, but argument 4 has type \u2018__u64\u2019 {aka \u2018long unsigned int\u2019} [-Werror=format=]\n  405 |         printf(\"ioctl(-1, \" XLAT_FMT \", {mask=%s\"\n      |                ^~~~~~~~~~~~\n......\n  413 |                info->cgroupid, info->pid, info->tgid, info->ppid,\n      |                ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n      |                    |\n      |                    __u64 {aka long unsigned int}\nioctl_pidfd_get_info.c:406:31: note: format string is defined here\n  406 |                \", cgroupid=%llu, pid=%d, tgid=%d, ppid=%d\"\n      |                            ~~~^\n      |                               |\n      |                               long long unsigned int\n      |                            %lu\ncc1: all warnings being treated as errors\nmake[4]: *** [Makefile:19169: ioctl_pidfd_get_info-success.o] Error 1\n````\n",
