++  "body": "The fix in b2f55b6a137855ce399cdcf8b362cdfb6efb13ad was not enough, we need to apply it to more test helper functions, but more importantly we have to change the regex to allow matching for:\r\n\r\n`clock_gettime64(CLOCK_MONOTONIC, {tv_sec=1330, tv_nsec=507731034}) = 0`\r\n\r\nwhich contains a `=`, so we can't match for `[^=]`.\r\n\r\nUbuntu Bug: https://bugs.launchpad.net/ubuntu/+source/strace/+bug/2143059\r\nDebian Bug: https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1125942",
