++  "body": "Hi,\n\nI uploaded the [6.18](https://buildd.debian.org/status/package.php?p=strace) to Debian unstable, but unfortunately, it had FTBFS issues on armhf and s390 due to tests failed.\n\narmhf [log](https://buildd.debian.org/status/fetch.php?pkg=strace&arch=armhf&ver=6.18%2Bds-1&stamp=1766562399&raw=0):\n\n```\nFAIL: clock.gen.test\nFAIL: trace_clock.gen.test\nFAIL: trace_personality_regex_32.gen.test\nFAIL: trace_personality_regex_32.gen.test\n```\n\ns390x [log](https://buildd.debian.org/status/fetch.php?pkg=strace&arch=s390x&ver=6.18%2Bds-1&stamp=1766563180&raw=0):\n\n```\nFAIL: clock.gen.test\nFAIL: trace_clock.gen.test\nFAIL: trace_personality_regex_32.gen.test\nFAIL: trace_personality_regex_32.gen.test\n```",
