++  "body": "Since https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/stable/linux.git/commit/?id=fd87b7783802b45cdd261b273e6b2b792823064d , strace fails to compile on parisc (hppa):\n```\nhppa2.0-unknown-linux-gnu-gcc -DHAVE_CONFIG_H   -I./linux/hppa -I./linux/hppa -I./linux/generic -I./linux/generic -I. -I. -isystem ../bundled/linux/arch/parisc/include/uapi -isystem ../bundled/linux/include/uapi -DIN_STRACE=1      -isystem ./bundled/linux/arch/parisc/include/uapi -isystem ./bundled/linux/include/uapi -Wall -Wextra -Wno-missing-field-initializers -Wno-unused-parameter -Wdate-time -Wformat-security -Wimplicit-fallthrough=5 -Winit-self -Wlogical-op -Wmissing-prototypes -Wnested-externs -Wold-style-definition -Wtrampolines -Wundef -Wwrite-strings  -O2 -pipe -march=2.0 -c -o libstrace_a-msghdr.o `test -f 'msghdr.c' || echo './'`msghdr.c\nIn file included from static_assert.h:11,\n                 from macros.h:16,\n                 from list.h:90,\n                 from defs.h:40,\n                 from msghdr.c:13:\nxlat/scmvals.h:102:1: error: static assertion failed: \"SCM_DEVMEM_LINEAR != 0x4e\"\n  102 | static_assert((SCM_DEVMEM_LINEAR) == (0x4e), \"SCM_DEVMEM_LINEAR != 0x4e\");\n      | ^~~~~~~~~~~~~\nxlat/scmvals.h:109:1: error: static assertion failed: \"SCM_DEVMEM_DMABUF != 0x4f\"\n  109 | static_assert((SCM_DEVMEM_DMABUF) == (0x4f), \"SCM_DEVMEM_DMABUF != 0x4f\");\n      | ^~~~~~~~~~~~~\nmake[3]: *** [Makefile:6455: libstrace_a-msghdr.o] Error 1\n```\nDownstream report:  https://bugs.gentoo.org/965573",
