++  "body": "After updating strace to 6.18, new test suite failures appeared:\n\n```\n--- exp\n+++ out\n@@ -336,7 +336,7 @@\n bpf(BPF_BTF_LOAD, 0x7f9d51d1bff9, 8) = -1 EFAULT (Bad address)\n bpf(BPF_BTF_LOAD, {btf=\"bPf\\0daTum\", btf_log_buf=0xfacefeeddeadbeef, btf_size=9, btf_log_size=4294967295, btf_log_level=42}, 28) = -1 EINVAL (Invalid argument)\n bpf(BPF_BTF_LOAD, 0x7f9d51d1bfe5, 28) = -1 EFAULT (Bad address)\n-bpf(BPF_BTF_LOAD, {btf=NULL, btf_log_buf=NULL, btf_size=0, btf_log_size=0, btf_log_level=0, btf_log_true_size=4207869677}, 32) = -1 EINVAL (Invalid argument)\n+bpf(BPF_BTF_LOAD, {btf=NULL, btf_log_buf=NULL, btf_size=0, btf_log_size=0, btf_log_level=0, btf_log_true_size=0}, 32) = -1 EINVAL (Invalid argument)\n bpf(BPF_BTF_LOAD, 0x7f9d51d1bfe1, 32) = -1 EFAULT (Bad address)\n bpf(BPF_BTF_LOAD, {btf=NULL, btf_log_buf=NULL, btf_size=0, btf_log_size=0, btf_log_level=0, btf_log_true_size=0, btf_flags=0, btf_token_fd=-1}, 40) = -1 EINVAL (Inval)\n bpf(BPF_BTF_LOAD, 0x7f9d51d1bfd9, 40) = -1 EFAULT (Bad address)\nbpf.gen.test: failed test: ../../src/strace -e trace=bpf -a20 ../bpf output mismatch\nFAIL bpf.gen.test (exit status: 1)\n```\n\nand a similar one:\n\n```\n--- exp\n+++ out\n@@ -336,7 +336,7 @@\n bpf(BPF_BTF_LOAD, 0x7ff3e2fc7ff9, 8) = -1 EFAULT (Bad address)\n bpf(BPF_BTF_LOAD, {btf=\"bPf\\0daTum\", btf_log_buf=0xfacefeeddeadbeef, btf_size=9, btf_log_size=4294967295, btf_log_level=42}, 28) = -1 EINVAL (Invalid argument)\n bpf(BPF_BTF_LOAD, 0x7ff3e2fc7fe5, 28) = -1 EFAULT (Bad address)\n-bpf(BPF_BTF_LOAD, {btf=NULL, btf_log_buf=NULL, btf_size=0, btf_log_size=0, btf_log_level=0, btf_log_true_size=4207869677}, 32) = -1 EINVAL (Invalid argument)\n+bpf(BPF_BTF_LOAD, {btf=NULL, btf_log_buf=NULL, btf_size=0, btf_log_size=0, btf_log_level=0, btf_log_true_size=0}, 32) = -1 EINVAL (Invalid argument)\n bpf(BPF_BTF_LOAD, 0x7ff3e2fc7fe1, 32) = -1 EFAULT (Bad address)\n bpf(BPF_BTF_LOAD, {btf=NULL, btf_log_buf=NULL, btf_size=0, btf_log_size=0, btf_log_level=0, btf_log_true_size=0, btf_flags=0, btf_token_fd=-1}, 40) = -1 EINVAL (Inval)\n bpf(BPF_BTF_LOAD, 0x7ff3e2fc7fd9, 40) = -1 EFAULT (Bad address)\nbpf-v.gen.test: failed test: ../../src/strace -a20 -v -e trace=bpf ../bpf-v output mismatch\nFAIL bpf-v.gen.test (exit status: 1)\n```",
