++  "body": "Following tests fail on musl systems\n\npreadv-pwritev.gen.test'\npread64-pwrite64.gen.test\npwritev.gen.test\n\nThe reason being, [musl wraps]( https://git.musl-libc.org/cgit/musl/commit/src?id=5370070fded61b569196764673a4fc8440aac79e) pwritev/pwrite64 around `pwritev2`\nwhich means that diffs between exp and out files do not match, since strace tests are\nexpecting pwritev/pwrite64 syscalls directly.\n\nPerhaps these tests should call the syscalls directly instead of going through libc functions.\n\nPart of this problem is fixed with #347 ",
