++  "body": "musl-libc handles the `pwrite` calls differently than glibc, making the uio tests fail. Using glibc, there are separated `pwrite` and `pwritev` calls, however musl uses only `pwritev2` for both `pwrite` and `pwritev`.\r\n\r\nTo account to this difference, change the verifying regex in way to match both glibc and musl outputs.\r\n\r\nCloses #346 ",
