++  "body": "I'm trying to cross compile `strace` for Android API 33 and it sounds like some header files are conflicting between `bundled/linux/include` and Android NDK sysroot headers.\n\nUsing this script : \n```\n#!/bin/sh -e\nNDK_PATH=\"/media/rafael/projects/android-ndk-r27c\"\nBUILDFLAG=\"--enable-mpers=no --host=aarch64-linux-android\"\nARCH=\"aarch64\"\nexport CC=\"$NDK_PATH/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/linux-x86_64/bin/${ARCH}-linux-android33-clang\"\nexport CFLAGS=\"-Os\\\n -fomit-frame-pointer\\\n -static\\\n\"\n\n./bootstrap\n./configure $BUILDFLAG #--enable-maintainer-mode\nmake CC=\"$CC\" CFLAGS=\"$CFLAGS\" | tee build.log\n```\n\nGetting some of these : \n```\nIn file included from block.c:17:\n../bundled/linux/include/uapi/linux/fs.h:46:9: error: 'RENAME_NOREPLACE' macro redefined [-Werror,-Wmacro-redefined]\n   46 | #define RENAME_NOREPLACE        (1 << 0)        /* Don't overwrite target */\n      |         ^\n/media/rafael/projects/android-ndk-r27c/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/linux-x86_64/bin/../sysroot/usr/include/stdio.h:178:9: note: previous definition is here\n  178 | #define RENAME_NOREPLACE (1<<0)\n      |         ^\n```\n\nWith `-Wno-error` I end up with conflicts again in the headers leading to errors anyways. \n\nAny pointer would be appreciated. ",
