++  "body": "Christian Brauner has suggested that it is now possible to translate PIDs without the currently implemented convoluted procfs dance using recently implemented ioctls that allow getting PIDNS fds (my guess: `PIDFD_GET_PID_NAMESPACE`, from `v6.11-rc1~234^2`[1]) and, crucially, converting PIDs using PIDNS fd (`NS_GET_PID_IN_PIDNS`/`NS_GET_TGID_IN_PIDNS`, I presume, from `v6.11-rc1~235^2`[2]).\r\n\r\n[1] https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git/commit/?id=5b08bd408534bfb3a7cf5778da5b27d4e4fffe12\r\n[2] https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git/commit/?id=ca567df74a28a9fb368c6b2d93e864113f73f5c2",
