++  "body": "When decoding an `RTM_GETNEIGH` message, **strace** interprets the data immediately after the netlink message header as a `struct ifinfomsg`.  However, it is actually a `struct ndmsg`.\r\n\r\nSee `RTM_GETNEIGH` in https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man7/rtnetlink.7.html.\r\n\r\nRun `strace bridge fdb show br $BRIDGE` to see this behavior.",
