++  "body": "Hello,\r\n\r\nVery simple addition as I noticed the Lustre distributed filesystem magic codes were not present in the defined values.\r\n\r\nI also noticed the project uses `EXT2_SUPER_MAGIC` for `0xef53` when from my understanding the value is used for `ext2`, `ext3`, `ext4` and derivatives. I did not touch that but was wondering if it should be renamed to `EXT_SUPER_MAGIC`.",
