++  "body": "Hello,I meet a problem:make check failed about strace@6.2 on openEuler22_aarch64 \r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce the issue\r\n\r\n```console\r\ncommond:make check\r\n\r\nfailed:\r\nFAIL: ksysent.gen\r\n=================\r\n\r\nerror: \"kabi_reserved441\" syscall #441 is \"epoll_pwait2\" in syscallent.h\r\nerror: \"kabi_reserved442\" syscall #442 is \"mount_setattr\" in syscallent.h\r\nerror: \"kabi_reserved443\" syscall #443 is \"quotactl_fd\" in syscallent.h\r\nerror: \"kabi_reserved444\" syscall #444 is \"landlock_create_ruleset\" in syscallent.h\r\nerror: \"kabi_reserved445\" syscall #445 is \"landlock_add_rule\" in syscallent.h\r\nerror: \"kabi_reserved446\" syscall #446 is \"landlock_restrict_self\" in syscallent.h\r\nerror: \"kabi_reserved447\" syscall #447 is \"memfd_secret\" in syscallent.h\r\nerror: \"kabi_reserved448\" syscall #448 is \"process_mrelease\" in syscallent.h\r\nerror: \"kabi_reserved449\" syscall #449 is \"futex_waitv\" in syscallent.h\r\nerror: \"kabi_reserved450\" syscall #450 is \"set_mempolicy_home_node\" in syscallent.h\r\nwarning: \"kabi_reserved451\" syscall #451 is missing in syscallent.h\r\nwarning: \"kabi_reserved452\" syscall #452 is missing in syscallent.h\r\nwarning: \"kabi_reserved453\" syscall #453 is missing in syscallent.h\r\nwarning: \"kabi_reserved454\" syscall #454 is missing in syscallent.h\r\nwarning: \"kabi_reserved455\" syscall #455 is missing in syscallent.h\r\nwarning: \"kabi_reserved456\" syscall #456 is missing in syscallent.h\r\nFAIL ksysent.gen.test (exit status: 1)\r\n\r\nFAIL: prctl-sve.gen\r\n===================\r\n\r\n--- exp 2023-04-24 16:46:47.238408000 +0800\r\n+++ out 2023-04-24 16:46:47.238408000 +0800\r\n@@ -3,5 +3,5 @@\r\n prctl(PR_SVE_SET_VL, PR_SVE_SET_VL_ONEXEC|0xff) = -1 EINVAL (Invalid argument)\r\n prctl(PR_SVE_SET_VL, PR_SVE_VL_INHERIT|0xff) = -1 EINVAL (Invalid argument)\r\n prctl(PR_SVE_SET_VL, PR_SVE_SET_VL_ONEXEC|PR_SVE_VL_INHERIT|0xff) = -1 EINVAL (Invalid argument)\r\n-prctl(PR_SVE_GET_VL) = 32 (PR_SVE_SET_VL_ONEXEC|PR_SVE_VL_INHERIT|0xff)\r\n+prctl(PR_SVE_GET_VL) = 0x20\r\n +++ exited with 0 +++\r\nprctl-sve.gen.test: failed test: ../../src/strace -eprctl -a21 ../prctl-sve output mismatch\r\nFAIL prctl-sve.gen.test (exit status: 1)\r\n```\r\nCan you tell me how to resolve these two cases?",
