++  "body": "In https://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/71bdea6f798b425bc0003780b13e3fdecb16a010, parisc removed their special madvise constant values which were inconsistent with other arches.  This causes the following build failure:\r\n\r\n```\r\nIn file included from static_assert.h:11,\r\n                 from macros.h:16,\r\n                 from list.h:90,\r\n                 from defs.h:40,\r\n                 from mem.c:14:\r\nxlat/madvise_cmds.h:253:1: error: static assertion failed: \"MADV_COLLAPSE != 73\"\r\n  253 | static_assert((MADV_COLLAPSE) == (73), \"MADV_COLLAPSE != 73\");\r\n      | ^~~~~~~~~~~~~\r\n```\r\n\r\nLooks like the workarounds in `madvise_cmds.h` for this arch need to be removed if kernel headers are >=6.2.",
