++  "body": "Hi,\r\n\r\nI noticed that commit https://github.com/strace/strace/commit/d65d4c13fb9f6531399aacb560087e89fc24a282 added an exception for the Landlock ruleset file descriptor name. I think this is not needed because the [original kernel commit](https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/stable/linux.git/commit/?id=aea0b9f2486da8497f35c7114b764bf55e17c7ea) has been [backported to the latest supported kernel version](https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/stable/linux.git/commit/?id=3d4b396a616d0d67bf95d6823ad1197f6247292e) (Linux 5.15).\r\n\r\nCc @ldv-alt @esyr @brauner",
