++  "body": "These 3 macros\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/strace/strace/blob/12dca391683d60984475ec659876c91e6e691149/bundled/linux/include/uapi/linux/fs.h#L46\r\n\r\nare already defined in the Android NDK so I had to comment when compiling to Android doing this:\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -ex\r\nexport TOOLCHAIN=${ANDROID_NDK_HOME}/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/linux-x86_64\r\nexport TARGET=aarch64-linux-android\r\n#minSdkVersion.\r\nexport API=28\r\nexport AR=$TOOLCHAIN/bin/llvm-ar\r\nexport CC=$TOOLCHAIN/bin/$TARGET$API-clang\r\nexport AS=$CC\r\nexport CXX=$TOOLCHAIN/bin/$TARGET$API-clang++\r\nexport LD=$TOOLCHAIN/bin/ld\r\nexport RANLIB=$TOOLCHAIN/bin/llvm-ranlib\r\nexport STRIP=$TOOLCHAIN/bin/llvm-strip\r\n(cd str && ./bootstrap && LDFLAGS=-static ./configure --disable-mpers --host $TARGET && make CFLAGS=\"-Wno-unused-function\")\r\n\r\n```",
