++  "body": "Version 5.11 includes bundled linux/socket.h (4aeaf0c86d3a7cbc8b7608edeea8e4b1a676a391), and then building strace for Android is broken.\r\n```\r\nx86_64-linux-android21-clang -DHAVE_CONFIG_H   -I./linux/x86_64 -I./linux/x86_64 -I./linux/generic -I./linux/generic -I. -I. -I../bundled/linux/arch/x86/include/uapi -I../bundled/linux/include/uapi -DIN_STRACE=1     -I./bundled/linux/arch/x86/include/uapi -I./bundled/linux/include/uapi -Wall -Wempty-body -Wformat-security -Wignored-qualifiers -Winit-self -Winitializer-overrides -Wnested-externs -Wold-style-definition -Woverride-init -Wsign-compare -Wtype-limits -Wwrite-strings   -g -O2 -MT libstrace_a-msghdr.o -MD -MP -MF .deps/libstrace_a-msghdr.Tpo -c -o libstrace_a-msghdr.o `test -f 'msghdr.c' || echo './'`msghdr.c\r\nIn file included from msghdr.c:16:\r\nIn file included from /opt/android-ndk/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/linux-x86_64/bin/../sysroot/usr/include/arpa/inet.h:32:\r\nIn file included from /opt/android-ndk/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/linux-x86_64/bin/../sysroot/usr/include/netinet/in.h:36:\r\n/opt/android-ndk/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/linux-x86_64/bin/../sysroot/usr/include/linux/in.h:157:27: error: field has incomplete type 'struct sockaddr_storage'\r\n  struct sockaddr_storage gr_group;\r\n                          ^\r\n/opt/android-ndk/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/linux-x86_64/bin/../sysroot/usr/include/linux/in.h:157:10: note: forward declaration of 'struct sockaddr_storage'\r\n  struct sockaddr_storage gr_group;\r\n         ^\r\n/opt/android-ndk/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/linux-x86_64/bin/../sysroot/usr/include/linux/in.h:161:27: error: field has incomplete type 'struct sockaddr_storage'\r\n  struct sockaddr_storage gsr_group;\r\n                          ^\r\n/opt/android-ndk/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/linux-x86_64/bin/../sysroot/usr/include/linux/in.h:157:10: note: forward declaration of 'struct sockaddr_storage'\r\n  struct sockaddr_storage gr_group;\r\n         ^\r\n/opt/android-ndk/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/linux-x86_64/bin/../sysroot/usr/include/linux/in.h:162:27: error: field has incomplete type 'struct sockaddr_storage'\r\n  struct sockaddr_storage gsr_source;\r\n                          ^\r\n/opt/android-ndk/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/linux-x86_64/bin/../sysroot/usr/include/linux/in.h:157:10: note: forward declaration of 'struct sockaddr_storage'\r\n  struct sockaddr_storage gr_group;\r\n         ^\r\n/opt/android-ndk/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/linux-x86_64/bin/../sysroot/usr/include/linux/in.h:166:27: error: field has incomplete type 'struct sockaddr_storage'\r\n  struct sockaddr_storage gf_group;\r\n                          ^\r\n/opt/android-ndk/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/linux-x86_64/bin/../sysroot/usr/include/linux/in.h:157:10: note: forward declaration of 'struct sockaddr_storage'\r\n  struct sockaddr_storage gr_group;\r\n         ^\r\n/opt/android-ndk/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/linux-x86_64/bin/../sysroot/usr/include/linux/in.h:169:35: error: array has incomplete element type 'struct sockaddr_storage'\r\n  struct sockaddr_storage gf_slist[1];\r\n                                  ^\r\n/opt/android-ndk/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/linux-x86_64/bin/../sysroot/usr/include/linux/in.h:157:10: note: forward declaration of 'struct sockaddr_storage'\r\n  struct sockaddr_storage gr_group;\r\n         ^\r\nmsghdr.c:240:14: error: invalid application of 'sizeof' to an incomplete type 'struct sockaddr_storage'\r\n                data_len > sizeof(struct sockaddr_storage)\r\n                           ^     ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\r\n/opt/android-ndk/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/linux-x86_64/bin/../sysroot/usr/include/linux/in.h:157:10: note: forward declaration of 'struct sockaddr_storage'\r\n  struct sockaddr_storage gr_group;\r\n         ^\r\nmsghdr.c:241:5: error: invalid application of 'sizeof' to an incomplete type 'struct sockaddr_storage'\r\n                ? sizeof(struct sockaddr_storage) : data_len;\r\n                  ^     ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\r\n/opt/android-ndk/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/linux-x86_64/bin/../sysroot/usr/include/linux/in.h:157:10: note: forward declaration of 'struct sockaddr_storage'\r\n  struct sockaddr_storage gr_group;\r\n         ^\r\n7 errors generated.\r\n```\r\nSteps to reproduce:\r\n1. Instald Android NDK r22\r\n2. `export PATH=\"/opt/android-ndk/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/linux-x86_64/bin:$PATH\"`\r\n3. `./bootstrap`\r\n4. `CC=x86_64-linux-android21-clang ./configure --host=x86_64-linux-android --without-libunwind --enable-mpers=no --disable-gcc-Werror`\r\n5. `make`\r\n\r\nSimilar errors occur with aarch64-linux-android21 as well. If I remove bundled `linux/socket.h`, building is fine for both x86_64 and aarch64.",
