++  "body": "Hi all,\r\n\r\nRecently, I tried to support my own board with strace.\r\nDue to there were no enough space on my guest board for the native toolchain environment,\r\nso I built strace using cross-compiler on my host PC.\r\n\r\nThen I tried to run the \"make check\" tests to make sure my strace works fine. \r\nBut I couldn't find a way to remotely run the \"make check\" test scripts.\r\n\r\nIs there a way to run the check script without using native toolchain environment ?\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nDylan",
