++  "body": "with `-e inject=` it's possible to make some syscalls to fail, unfortunately the interface for selecting which ones should fail (`:when=`) is very limited: it is based only on the number of given syscalls called\r\n\r\nwhen the number of calls performed by application is large or the ordering of them is not completely deterministic, the counting approach does not work\r\n\r\nability to select a syscall to fail based on parameters (or flags) would make it more useful",
