++  "body": "Can't build strace-4.24 on x86_64, i686, armv7hl, aarch64 and znver1\r\nMore logs here http://file-store.openmandriva.org/api/v1/file_stores/3da6f0c39e3ffac53851522932ebcf30155261c8.log?show=true\r\n\r\n```\r\ngcc -DHAVE_CONFIG_H   -I./linux/x86_64 -I./linux/x86_64 -I./linux -I./linux -I. -I.     -DIN_MPERS -DMPERS_IS_m32 -I./mpers-m32  -Wall -Wempty-body -Wformat-security -Wignored-qualifiers -Wimplicit-fallthrough=5 -Winit-self -Wlogical-op -Wmissing-parameter-type -Wnested-externs -Wold-style-declaration -Wold-style-definition -Wsign-compare -Wtype-limits -Wwrite-strings   -Os -gdwarf-4 -Wstrict-aliasing=2 -pipe -Wformat -Werror=format-security -D_FORTIFY_SOURCE=2 -fstack-protector-strong --param=ssp-buffer-size=4  -fPIC -flto -c -o libmpers_m32_a-v4l2.o `test -f 'v4l2.c' || echo './'`v4l2.c\r\nmake[2]: Leaving directory '/builddir/build/BUILD/strace-4.24'\r\nBUILDSTDERR: In file included from ./static_assert.h:31,\r\nBUILDSTDERR:                  from xlat/v4l2_pix_fmts.h:4,\r\nBUILDSTDERR:                  from v4l2.c:78:\r\nBUILDSTDERR: xlat/v4l2_control_id_bases.h:36:1: error: static assertion failed: \"V4L2_CID_USER_IMX_BASE != (V4L2_CID_BASE + 0x1090)\"\r\nBUILDSTDERR:  static_assert((V4L2_CID_USER_IMX_BASE) == ((V4L2_CID_BASE + 0x1090)), \"V4L2_CID_USER_IMX_BASE != (V4L2_CID_BASE + 0x1090)\");\r\nBUILDSTDERR:  ^~~~~~~~~~~~~\r\nBUILDSTDERR: v4l2.c: In function 'print_v4l2_create_buffers':\r\nBUILDSTDERR: v4l2.c:975:34: warning: dereferencing type-punned pointer might break strict-aliasing rules [-Wstrict-aliasing]\r\nBUILDSTDERR:            (struct_v4l2_format *) &b.format);\r\nBUILDSTDERR:                                   ^~~~~~~~~\r\nBUILDSTDERR: make[2]: *** [Makefile:3081: libmpers_m32_a-v4l2.o] Error 1\r\nBUILDSTDERR: make[2]: *** Waiting for unfinished jobs....\r\nmake[2]: Entering directory '/builddir/build/BUILD/strace-4.24'\r\n```",
