++  "body": "We can add an option to trace these `CLONE_UNTRACED` processes. Just clear the `CLONE_UNTRACED` flag when entering `sys_clone`:\r\n\r\n```c\r\nlong flags = get_syscall_arg(tcp->pid, 0);\r\nflags &= ~CLONE_UNTRACED;\r\nptrace(PTRACE_POKEUSER, tcp->pid, sizeof(long)*RDI, flags); // for X86_64\r\n```\r\n\r\nBTW, there was a related RedHat bug before: https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=642389 , so I am not sure if this forced tracing option is needed.\r\n",
