++  "body": "I'm seeing signal_receive.gen.test failures on our F-27 armv7 machine since yesterday.\r\n\r\nThe diff between \"exp\" and \"log\" is\r\n````\r\n16c16\r\n< --- SIGFPE {si_signo=SIGFPE, si_code=SI_USER, si_pid=15863, si_uid=1003} ---\r\n---\r\n> --- SIGFPE {si_signo=SIGFPE, si_code=SI_USER, si_pid=15863, si_uid=0} ---\r\n\r\n````\r\nand test-suite.log has\r\n````\r\nFAIL: signal_receive.gen\r\n========================\r\n\r\n--- exp 2018-06-15 20:16:54.539922452 +0200\r\n+++ log 2018-06-15 20:16:54.539922452 +0200\r\n@@ -13,7 +13,7 @@\r\n kill(15863, SIGBUS) = 0\r\n --- SIGBUS {si_signo=SIGBUS, si_code=SI_USER, si_pid=15863, si_uid=1003} ---\r\n kill(15863, SIGFPE) = 0\r\n---- SIGFPE {si_signo=SIGFPE, si_code=SI_USER, si_pid=15863, si_uid=1003} ---\r\n+--- SIGFPE {si_signo=SIGFPE, si_code=SI_USER, si_pid=15863, si_uid=0} ---\r\n kill(15863, SIGUSR1) = 0\r\n --- SIGUSR1 {si_signo=SIGUSR1, si_code=SI_USER, si_pid=15863, si_uid=1003} ---\r\n kill(15863, SIGSEGV) = 0\r\nsignal_receive.gen.test: failed test: ../../strace -a16 -e trace=kill ../signal_receive output mismatch\r\nFAIL signal_receive.gen.test (exit status: 1)\r\n````",
