++  "body": "Im trying to `strace -f` a hierarchy of process where some processes are `ptrace()`-ing their children. Of course it doesn't work because `PTRACE_TRACEME` fails as the process is already `ptrace()`-ed by `strace.\n\nIt would be very helpful to have a `ptrace`-friendly mode where `strace` `PTRACE_DETACH` any process which tries to `PTRACE_TRACEME` and any process which is `PTRACE_ATTACH`-ed or `PTRACE_SEIZE`-d.\n",
