++  "body": "Sorry, I don't quite follow why --uid and --gid require --user.  According to the patch, --uid and --gid override whatever is specified by --user, so if that was the intent, then they are mutually exclusive.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, one could suggest not to introduce new options but extend --user instead: following the chown(1) example, --user=OWNER:GROUP could be given the meaning of --uid=OWNER --gid=GROUP.",
