++  "body": "That depends on where `CLOCKID_TO_FD()` is supposed to be coming from.\r\nIt looks like it is expected to come from libc, which would make it incompatible with `linux/time.h`.\r\nHowever neither glibc nor musl define this macro.\r\nThe whole `CLOCKID_TO_FD()` block looks dead to me, and doesn't work on my distro build of strace.\r\n\r\nSo I would first fix that and then move it to a dedicated translation unit.",
